# Canvix — Cloudflare Workers local preview secrets
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Used by `npm run preview` (opennextjs-cloudflare preview → wrangler dev).
# Production equivalents: `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`.

# ── Database (required) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Use the Supabase TRANSACTION POOLER URL (port 6543) — Workers cannot
# reach the IPv6-only direct endpoint, and the pooler multiplexes the
# many short-lived Worker isolates onto few real Postgres connections.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.[PROJECT-REF]:[PASSWORD]@aws-0-[REGION].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres

# ── AI provider (optional — all local features work without it) ──
# ZAI_BASE_URL=
# ZAI_API_KEY=
